{
  "$comment": "Endpoint list: source of relay.js launch args, read by deploy/ensure-proxy.ps1, deploy/install-tasks.ps1 and deploy/probe-subagent.ps1. Keep this file ASCII-only (Windows PowerShell 5.1 reads files as ANSI by default).",
